# Regeneration requires green mana: red alone cannot pay, and exactly green can activate it (CR 602.2b).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Ruby
Grizzly Bears
Regeneration
Shock
Island
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Grizzly Bears.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Regeneration.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Island)
Bot1.Hand.Regeneration.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Grizzly Bears)
